LRC14 COCYCLE CARRIER ATLAS
========================================================================

Executive readout:
A useful LRC cocycle is a signed local obstruction to forgetting a coordinate.  It lives on a labelled packet fiber, closes when local certificates glue, and becomes harmless only as a coboundary/potential, a dual-annihilated mode, a known boundary atom, a descended family, or a named residual sector.

Carrier dictionary:
- labelled_packet_master_cocycle
  base: packet base P(S)
  cochain: total lost-coordinate obstruction omega_P
  exits: strict witness, AP/GW atom, state-lift residual, or exact certificate
- haar_zipper_zeta
  base: 2 x 2 fixed-margin packet table
  cochain: zeta=T00-T01-T10+T11
  exits: color cancellation, boundary stop, handoff, descent, F7 debt
- endpoint_credit_winding
  base: danger-arc endpoint transition graph
  cochain: K(a,b)=14rs(R(a)-L(b))
  exits: potential Phi, AP/GW closed cycle, or K33/state lift
- carry_crt_cocycle
  base: Res_27 lift tower v=r+27k
  cochain: k mod 14 controls parity, apex divisibility, and pair sums
  exits: owner/Cprime repair, apex tax, scalar lift, or strictness
- owner_deletion_derivative
  base: visible Res_27/gcd shell quotient
  cochain: delta_owner(v)=obligations uncovered by deleting v
  exits: private-owner bit, carry support, or strict tax
- ramanujan_exact_period_trace
  base: exact denominator q and primitive q-th roots
  cochain: c_q(a-b) as exact-period character trace
  exits: primitive projector, endpoint-owner repair, or squarefree residual
- fejer_toeplitz_moment
  base: Fourier modes of C_S(t)-1
  cochain: quadratic Fejer form v* M v
  exits: negative quadratic certificate or interval proof payload
- boundary_moment_multichart
  base: exact-period denominator charts
  cochain: chart-to-chart moment defect
  exits: positive Haar-open chart, AP/GW equality, or residual chart debt
- product_rule_tiling
  base: Haar rectangles / fixed-path Walsh staircase tiles
  cochain: product class: zero, atom, owner strip, handoff, descent, residual
  exits: orthogonality, owner reconstruction, dual annihilation, or residual
- farey_k33_determinant
  base: exact M=p/q Farey node
  cochain: determinant/excess e=14p-q and K_{p,q} incidence depth
  exits: p=1 AP/GW, p=2 C27, p>=3 K33/Fejer/state lift
- c27_unital_transfer
  base: C=27 antipodal shell / q=3 unital block
  cochain: local pair-completion transfer defect
  exits: petal, GW transfer, K33 branch, or state-lift debt
- root_packet_boundary
  base: type-A root-sign chain complex
  cochain: sum of roots = endpoint boundary; closed packets have zero boundary
  exits: packet compatibility, incidence rank, or homology residue
- metagraph_transfer_cocycle
  base: operation/metagraph state graph
  cochain: successor defect or transfer-matrix curvature
  exits: state-vector refinement, support residue, or SCC debt
- sequence_shadow_difference
  base: n+2 / n*2 / companion sequence recursions
  cochain: finite difference under add/multiply mode changes
  exits: state split, derivative repair, or discarded analogy
- octahedral_hodge_current
  base: octahedral/K4 face-current support
  cochain: discrete curl/divergence defect
  exits: Hodge split, tail repair, or residual current
- ocf_activity_coimage
  base: odd-cycle compatibility graph
  cochain: hard-core activity residue
  exits: coimage sector, path homology residue, or support repair

